=== DSR on best OOS strategy (link P2 backtest-traps) ===
rule: DSR uses the SAME OOS net-return series that produced OOS_net_SR / the choice — never mix full-sample PnL with an OOS ranking
best_strategy=pairs_rolling
N_trials=4
OOS_raw_SR_trials=[-0.106364, -0.105409, -0.17948, -0.029883] sigma_SR_OOS=0.061078
sr_daily=-0.029883 sr_ann=-0.4744 table_OOS_net_SR=-0.4744
ASSERT_sr_daily_times_sqrt252_matches_table_OOS_SR: OK (diff=0.00e+00)
SR_star_Emax=0.064262 DSR=0.188677 n_obs_OOS=90
formula: DSR = PSR(SR̂, SR*=E[max SR under N trials], n, skew, kurt_Pearson) on OOS bars only
teach: even the horse-race winner must clear a multiple-testing bar — see P2 DSR vs N

